rt>しんりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>予約<rp>(</rp><rt>よやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってもらえますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我能约个时间进行体检吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">進路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しんろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">路线；路径；路程；前途；前程；（毕业后的）人生方向</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144707\"><ruby>進路<rp>(</rp><rt>しんろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことで<ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>助言<rp>(</rp><rt>じょげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>求<rp>(</rp><rt>もと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我问我的老师 关于我的未来路线的建议。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">シート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">座位；座椅</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">次</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">下一；其次；（化学）次（表示含低价元素，如次氯酸）；次；回；序；顺序</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74447\"><ruby>画像<rp>(</rp><rt>がぞう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をクリックすると<ruby>次<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ページへ<ruby>移<rp>(</rp><rt>うつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">单击图片到下一页!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自覚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じかく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自我意识；自觉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149978\"><ruby>自分<rp>(</rp><rt>じぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>欠点<rp>(</rp><rt>けってん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>自覚<rp>(</rp><rt>じかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するべきです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们应该意识到我们的缺点。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地方</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じかた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（日本舞蹈表演中的）音乐负责人；（能剧中的）说唱者；吟唱者；（尤其从水上看到的）海岸；岸边；乡村；农村；地方；郡县</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">自我</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じが</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（哲学）自我；（心理学）自身；自己；（精神分析）自我</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97372\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>喜<rp>(</rp><rt>よろこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びのあまりすっかり<ruby>自我<rp>(</rp><rt>じが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をわすれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们很快乐地在他们身边</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">磁器</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">瓷器；瓷制品</sp